WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
You need an invitation to get in if something goes wrong

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,040
Don't understand any rules

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,960
You are so brave

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,480
Be a dog at the door

5
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,150
I really thought I was a stupid Uru, do it to me

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,340
Take this guy and leave

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,340
I want to see how he takes me down

8
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,900
Prince Xia, your invitation

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:33,090
I deliberately burned it to ashes with fire

10
00:00:33,570 --> 00:00:34,970
Can I still participate in Yan Hui?

11
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,410
Don't know what it means

12
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:37,970
The Holy Lord’s vision this time

13
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:39,530
I brought you here

14
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:41,090
The Holy Lord’s vision this time

15
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:42,970
It does look like he's injured and there's this

16
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,490
Linglangtian condenses the heart of the sword

17
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:45,890
That's just what I think

18
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:47,570
Even my Void Wilderness Prize can't be broken

19
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:48,890
You hit my royal sister

20
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:50,690
Now I hurt someone again

21
00:00:50,890 --> 00:00:51,850
I'm curious

22
00:00:52,050 --> 00:00:54,250
Who gave you the courage to do this, thief?

23
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,210
Prince Xia kindly invites you to participate in Yan Hui

24
00:00:56,410 --> 00:00:57,610
Since you act like this

25
00:00:57,810 --> 00:00:59,010
It's so life-changing
